    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberate the system and purge it of corrupted Programs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BitLiberator is a strategy/puzzle/action game where you eliminate corrupted Programs by either destroying them or reprogramming them. You can control friendly reprogrammed Programs and connect them into more powerful structures. You can also apply Upgrades to your Programs, allowing them to perform actions such as shooting enemies, shielding themselves from enemy fire, or slowing enemies down. However, be warned that, over time, corrupted Programs will detect you and start moving toward you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this game, your enemies are not just a threat, but also a resource\u2014and they are imperiled. The game encourages fighting to save lives, which is why it awards Liberations for each surviving allied Program after a level. Accumulate Liberations to increase your Energy Charges, allowing you to use Upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn but difficult to master, the game will test your skill and creativity across more than 100 increasingly challenging levels!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberate the system and purge it of corrupted Programs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BitLiberator is a strategy/puzzle/action game where you eliminate corrupted Programs by either destroying them or reprogramming them. You can control friendly reprogrammed Programs and connect them into more powerful structures. You can also apply Upgrades to your Programs, allowing them to perform actions such as shooting enemies, shielding themselves from enemy fire, or slowing enemies down. However, be warned that, over time, corrupted Programs will detect you and start moving toward you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this game, your enemies are not just a threat, but also a resource\u2014and they are imperiled. The game encourages fighting to save lives, which is why it awards Liberations for each surviving allied Program after a level. Accumulate Liberations to increase your Energy Charges, allowing you to use Upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn but difficult to master, the game will test your skill and creativity across more than 100 increasingly challenging levels!</p>",
    "short_description": "A challenging top-down strategy-puzzle-action game where you convert enemies into allies and link them to form powerful upgraded structures. Think and act quickly, or you'll be overwhelmed in just half a minute!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
